{"id":"n15642-2-7","stage":3,"title":"빛나다 · 闪光","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15642-2-7-1","ko":"저기 좀 봐. 참 예쁘다.","zh":"快看那边。真漂亮啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저기","meaning":"那里，那儿","explanation":"저기：那里，那儿","readings":[{"term":"저기","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71218","senseId":"1","lemma":"저기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"봐.","meaning":"看","explanation":"보다：看；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"보다","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61190","senseId":"1","lemma":"보다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"참","meaning":"真，实在，的确","explanation":"참：真，实在，的确","readings":[{"term":"참","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71761","senseId":"1","lemma":"참","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"예쁘다.","meaning":"漂亮，好看","explanation":"예쁘다：漂亮，好看；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"예쁘다","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89697","senseId":"1","lemma":"예쁘다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"1a8b5723b01cfd93","term":"저기","zh":"那里，那儿","audio":"/audio/1a8b5723b01cfd9368f8.mp3","entryId":"71218","definition":"指代离说话人或听话人很远的地方。","pronunciation":["저기"]},{"id":"70ae9bc35b2d378b","term":"좀","zh":"一下","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3","entryId":"75798","definition":"主要用于委婉请求或征得同意。","pronunciation":["좀"]},{"id":"6a45cf834264a5ec","term":"보다","zh":"看","audio":"/audio/6a45cf834264a5ec3611.mp3","entryId":"61190","definition":"用眼睛识辨对象的存在或外观。","pronunciation":["보다"]},{"id":"8e09b5f4c09195e3","term":"참","zh":"真，实在，的确","audio":"/audio/8e09b5f4c09195e322ba.mp3","entryId":"71761","definition":"毫不违背事实或道理，真正地。","pronunciation":["참"]},{"id":"f62ff8982d788e72","term":"예쁘다","zh":"漂亮，好看","audio":"/audio/f62ff8982d788e72028f.mp3","entryId":"89697","definition":"长相看起来美丽，让人喜欢。","pronunciation":["예ː쁘다"]}],"audio":"/audio/4abd9d44f6035c347b21.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15642-2-7-2","ko":"강물이 햇빛을 받아서 빛나니까 꼭 다이아몬드 같네.","zh":"江水反射着阳光闪闪发光，简直就像钻石一样。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"강물이","meaning":"江水，河水","explanation":"강물：江水，河水；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"강물","audio":"/audio/3d813865c018ad5e2e1e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62662","senseId":"1","lemma":"강물","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"햇빛을","meaning":"阳光，日光","explanation":"햇빛：阳光，日光；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"햇빛","audio":"/audio/53e1a4a868c33516d0ea.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72476","senseId":"1","lemma":"햇빛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"받아서","meaning":"受，晒，吹","explanation":"받다：受，晒，吹；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"8","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"빛나니까","meaning":"闪光，闪烁，发光","explanation":"빛나다：闪光，闪烁，发光；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"빛나다","audio":"/audio/a7936a104a33327719b2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15642","senseId":"2","lemma":"빛나다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"仿佛，好像","explanation":"꼭：仿佛，好像","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"3","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"다이아몬드","meaning":"钻石","explanation":"다이아몬드：钻石","readings":[{"term":"다이아몬드","audio":"/audio/f45ada54cf13605025a2.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40579","senseId":"1","lemma":"다이아몬드","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"같네.","meaning":"相似，如同，像","explanation":"같다：相似，如同，像；네：对新发现的情况表示感叹或确认，非敬语句末。","readings":[{"term":"같다","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62076","senseId":"2","lemma":"같다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3d813865c018ad5e","term":"강물","zh":"江水，河水","audio":"/audio/3d813865c018ad5e2e1e.mp3","entryId":"62662","definition":"在江河里流淌的水。","pronunciation":["강물"]},{"id":"53e1a4a868c33516","term":"햇빛","zh":"阳光，日光","audio":"/audio/53e1a4a868c33516d0ea.mp3","entryId":"72476","definition":"太阳的光线。","pronunciation":["해삗","핻삗"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"受，晒，吹","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"使感受或接触光、热或风等。","pronunciation":["받따"]},{"id":"a7936a104a333277","term":"빛나다","zh":"闪光，闪烁，发光","audio":"/audio/a7936a104a33327719b2.mp3","entryId":"15642","definition":"光被反射而一闪一闪或发亮。","pronunciation":["빈나다"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"仿佛，好像","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"非常相似地。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"f45ada54cf136050","term":"다이아몬드","zh":"钻石","audio":"/audio/f45ada54cf13605025a2.mp3","entryId":"40579","definition":"一种闪烁着光芒的美丽宝石。为透明的天然矿物，非常坚硬。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"962ae18a075d06e2","term":"같다","zh":"相似，如同，像","audio":"/audio/962ae18a075d06e2b7fd.mp3","entryId":"62076","definition":"互相差不多。","pronunciation":["갇따"]}],"audio":"/audio/988db6eeb2f148d1dedb.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.873,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15642","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"중급","day":97,"sequenceScore":2.5983,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["江水反射着阳光闪闪发光，简直就像钻石一样。","快看那边。真漂亮啊。","房间怎么这么冷啊？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["快看那边。真漂亮啊。","房间怎么这么冷啊？","江水反射着阳光闪闪发光，简直就像钻石一样。"],"answer":2}]}
